
form pair
  head a
  head b
  link first, like a
  link second, like b

  task get-first
    take self
    like a
    send back, read self/first

  task get-second
    take self
    like b
    send back, read self/second

  task swap
    take self
    like pair
    send back
      make pair
        bind first, read self/second
        bind second, read self/first

  task map-first
    head c
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like a
        like c
    like pair
    send back
      make pair
        bind first
          call call
            read self/first
        bind second, read self/second

  task map-second
    head c
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like b
        like c
    like pair
    send back
      make pair
        bind first, read self/first
        bind second
          call call
            read self/second

  task map-both
    head c
    head d
    take self
    take on-first
      like task
        take value, like a
        like c
    take on-second
      like task
        take value, like b
        like d
    like pair
    send back
      make pair
        bind first
          call on-first
            read self/first
        bind second
          call on-second
            read self/second
